      We've finished our deep-dive into the `rpi.2040` distro package &ndash; incrementally adding drivers along the way.

      But before we move on to tackling **Energy Efficiency**, let's take a [relaxing&thinsp;!!] final tour of the **EMS** distro codescape.

      {[hc]}
